  "prefLabel": "Ed 1114.11 Employee and Volunteer Background Investigations",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 1114.11 Employee and Volunteer Background Investigations.\n\n(a) Each private provider of special education or other non-LEA program, including any individual providing direct services to the student pursuant to Ed 1126.05, shall complete a background investigation, consistent with the provisions of RSA 189:13-a, prior to a final offer of employment.\n\nSource. (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Ed 1100) #9197, eff 6-28-08; ss by #12141, eff 3-24-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ed1100.html"
